---
/** Contact composition; shared RFQ and quote-only answers; no fabricated contact channel. */
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';
import RFQ from '../components/RFQ.astro';
---
<Shell title="Contact / Request a quote"><section class="wrap split"><div><h1>Tell us what<br />you have in mind.</h1><p class="lead">Share a style code or describe your project. Add fabric, fit and sampling requirements to help us understand your brief.</p><p>Price, MOQ, lead time and sample cost: Confirmed in quote.</p></div><RFQ /></section><section class="wrap"><h2>Before you send</h2><details><summary>Can I ask about a sample?</summary><p>Include the style and the details you want to assess. Sample cost: Confirmed in quote.</p></details><details><summary>What if I do not have a tech pack?</summary><p>Describe the intended garment and share your fabric, fit and finish requirements in the message.</p></details><details><summary>What are the ordering terms?</summary><p>Price, MOQ, lead time and sample cost: Confirmed in quote.</p></details></section></Shell>
